   - AI Model Hub (Hugging Face GGUF / SafeTensors direct harvester with SHA-256).
   - Automated PC Sleep and Shutdown on task completion.
   - Cryptographically bound to Machine Hardware ID (HWID / MachineGuid).
   - Priority VIP developer support via WhatsApp hotline (+62 821-1200-1600).

C. Enterprise & Multi-Node Cluster:
